        "43358c8a-52ab-5951-a725-ac9b395eed95"
      ]
    },
    {
      "step_number": 2,
      "instruction": "When just about cool whisk together all the dressing ingredients with a little more seasoning and gently toss through the potato chunks – use your hands to avoid breaking them up."
    }
